{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PurchaseKit"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/rkpurchasekit\/gettingstarted"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","text":"1  Configure the SDK <a id=\"configure\"><\/a>","level":2,"anchor":"1-Configure-the-SDK-%3Ca-id=configure%3E%3Ca%3E"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"once","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" at app launch (e.g. inside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"type":"text","text":"):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import RKPurchaseKit","","PurchasesManager.configure(identifiers: [","    \"com.myapp.pro\",","    \"com.myapp.consumable.coin\",","    \"com.myapp.sub.premium.monthly\",","    \"com.myapp.sub.premium.yearly\"","])"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tip","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":"\n","type":"text"},{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"configure(identifiers:)"},{"text":" isn’t called, any later access to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/shared","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" will trap in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" builds to highlight the mistake."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"2  Fetch products <a id=\"fetch-products\"><\/a>","anchor":"2-Fetch-products-%3Ca-id=fetch-products%3E%3Ca%3E","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let products: [StoreProduct] =","    try await PurchasesManager.shared.requestProducts()"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Results are cached; repeat calls are instant & offline-safe."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"includingCache: false"},{"text":" to force a fresh fetch.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"3  Make a purchase <a id=\"purchase\"><\/a>","type":"heading","anchor":"3-Make-a-purchase-%3Ca-id=purchase%3E%3Ca%3E","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["do {","    let product = try await PurchasesManager.shared","                        .purchase(productID: \"com.myapp.pro\")","    print(\"🎉 Purchased:\", product.displayName)","} catch PurchasesError.purchaseCancelled {","    \/\/ user tapped “Cancel” – usually no error UI needed","} catch {","    \/\/ handle \/ log other errors","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The call throws typed errors defined in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"4  Listen to purchase events","type":"heading","anchor":"4-Listen-to-purchase-events","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["Task {","    for await event in PurchasesManager.shared.purchasedProducts {","        \/\/ hop to the main actor if you update UI","        await MainActor.run {","            print(\"✅ Entitlement updated:\", event.product.productID)","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"purchasedProducts","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" emits "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"both","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" new purchases and restored entitlements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so your UI stays in sync without delegates."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"5  Restore past purchases","type":"heading","anchor":"5-Restore-past-purchases","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["try await PurchasesManager.shared.restore()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provide an explicit “Restore Purchases” button if required by App Store Review."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"6  Gate features by entitlement","type":"heading","anchor":"6-Gate-features-by-entitlement","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use current entitlements to unlock features (no receipt parsing needed):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let hasPro = await PurchasesManager.shared.hasEntitlement(for: \"com.myapp.pro\")","","if hasPro {","    \/\/ unlock premium UI","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Or quickly check all entitled product identifiers:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let ids = await PurchasesManager.shared.entitlementProductIDs()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"See-docpurchasekitRKPurchaseKitdocumentationRKPurchaseKitPurchasesManagerhasEntitlementfor-docpurchasekitRKPurchaseKitdocumentationRKPurchaseKitPurchasesManagerentitlementProductIDs","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"See: ``doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/hasEntitlement(for:)``, ``doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/entitlementProductIDs()``"},{"anchor":"7-Work-with-subscriptions-groups","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"7  Work with subscriptions (groups)"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"List all active auto-renewable subscriptions:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let active = await PurchasesManager.shared.activeSubscriptions()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeL